[[Hoggaanka]] also known as a '''Hogan''' is a territory or domain ruled by a [[Hoga]]. In [[Burawa|Burawi]] tradition, a Hoga is a title given to those with the highest nobility below a monarch. The [[Hoggaanka system]] was established in 1105 as a formalization of the [[Family rule system (Burawa)|family rule]] system in the [[Kingdom of Burawa]].